until 300 CHOOSE YOUR ALLEGIANCE
click ENTER SHARED UNIVERSE
until 1200 SECTOR WAR
expect RIGHTEOUS REPUBLIC
until 3600 2/32 PILOTS
key KeyL 1
until 180 MINES 1/2
key KeyE 1
expect Build your flotilla.
click HULL / OUTFIT
expect SHIPYARD
click SHIP ROLES
expect ACTUAL SHIP
click RETURN
expect Build your flotilla.
key KeyE 1
key KeyW 60
key KeyD 30
key KeyS 30
click LEAVE UNIVERSE
until 300 CHOOSE YOUR ALLEGIANCE
click ENTER SHARED UNIVERSE
until 600 SECTOR WAR
frames 300
